graph LR
    direction LR
    Admin((Administrator)) --> UC1
    Admin --> UC2
    Admin --> UC3

    subgraph Attendance System - Admin Portal
        direction LR
        UC1[Manage User Accounts]
        UC2[Configure Campus Settings]
        UC3[Generate Attendance Reports]
        UC4[Verify Schedule Thresholds]
        UC5[Export Reports to CSV]

        UC2 -. "<<include>>" .-> UC4
        UC3 -. "<<extend>>" .-> UC5
    end